; The observer arena's map (game/arena/ObserverArena.tscn): 400 x 300 m of
; open ground with a street, a car park, three enterable buildings (the
; warehouse is big enough to fight in), parked cars that can sound an alarm,
; and trees and bushes. No exits: NPCs stay until they are deleted.
